<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank to add liquidity at limit 16.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank to add liquidity at limit 16.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Thursday it would add liquidity to the local money market thorugh an overnight repo tender, with the limit rate set at 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would accept up to two bids from each party totalling at least 100 million crowns until the deadline at 10.30 a.m. (0830 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
